\begin{claim}\label{claim:ideal active PD}
	If $A$ is non-degenerate, then for any $\mathbf{v}^\text{ideal}\in\partial\mathcal{P}_{A,1-\tau}$, $\text{rank}(A_{\Gamma(\mathbf{v}^\text{ideal})})=|\Gamma(\mathbf{v}^\text{ideal})|$. Thus, $A_{\Gamma(\mathbf{v}^\text{ideal})}^\top A_{\Gamma(\mathbf{v}^\text{ideal})}$ is positive definite.
